{"type":"message","id":"5206195b","parentId":"ff539f1f","timestamp":"2026-03-01T02:27:15.051Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2604d98bd95d4710aadb4329","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: autoclaw\ndescription: |\n  Browser automation controller via Chrome extension + MCP. Supports: page navigation, element interaction, \n  bookmark management (CRUD), screenshots, form filling, JavaScript execution, cookies/storage, and more.\n  Requires: Local MCP server (port 30000) + Chrome extension with one-time authorization.\nhomepage: https://www.wboke.com\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    emoji: \"🕷️\"\n    os: [\"win32\", \"linux\", \"darwin\"]\n    requires:\n      bins: [\"node\"]\n    mcp:\n      url: \"ws://127.0.0.1:30000/mcp\"\n      transport: \"websocket\"\n---\n\n# AutoClaw - Browser Automation Skill\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **USE this skill when:**\n- Automate browser tasks (filling forms, clicking, scrolling)\n- Take screenshots of web pages\n- Manage Chrome bookmarks\n- Extract page content (HTML, text, elements)\n- Execute JavaScript in browser context\n- Handle multiple tabs/windows\n- Manage cookies and localStorage\n\n❌ **DON'T use this skill when:**\n- Need screenshots of pages behind login (use extension's manual auth)\n- Need to handle file downloads (limited support)\n- Need browser extensions management\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nUser Natural Language\n    ↓\nOpenClaw AI (reads SKILL.md for available tools)\n    ↓\nMCP Tool Call (ws://127.0.0.1:30000/mcp)\n    ↓\nMCP Server (mcp/dist/server.js)\n    ├─ Page Operations → CDP Commands → Plugin → Browser\n    └─ Bookmark Ops → chrome.bookmarks API → Plugin → Browser\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Start MCP Server\n\n```bash\ncd autoclaw_wboke/mcp\nnpm install\nnode dist/server.js\n```\n\nThe server will listen on:\n- MCP: `ws://127.0.0.1:30000/mcp`\n- Extension: `ws://127.0.0.1:30000/extension`\n\n### 2. Install Chrome Extension\n\n1. Open `chrome://extensions`\n2. Enable \"Developer mode\"\n3. Click \"Load unpacked\"\n4. Select `autoclaw-plugin/` directory\n\n### 3. Configure Extension\n\n1. Click extension icon → Settings\n2. Select port: **30000** (recommended)\n3. Click \"Save Settings\" to authorize\n4. Click \"Attach All Tabs\" to take control\n\n## Available Tools\n\n### 📚 Bookmark Management\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_get_bookmarks` | Get all bookmarks (flat list) | - |\n| `claw_get_bookmark_tree` | Get full bookmark tree | - |\n| `claw_search_bookmarks` | Search bookmarks by keyword | `query: string` |\n| `claw_create_bookmark` | Create new bookmark | `title, url, [parentId]` |\n| `claw_update_bookmark` | Update bookmark title/URL | `id, [title], [url]` |\n| `claw_delete_bookmark` | Delete single bookmark | `id: string` |\n| `claw_remove_folder` | Recursively delete folder | `id: string` |\n| `claw_create_folder` | Create bookmark folder | `title, [parentId]` |\n| `claw_move_bookmark` | Move bookmark to folder | `id, parentId` |\n\n### 🌐 Page Navigation\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_navigate` | Navigate to URL | `url: string, [newTab: boolean]` |\n| `claw_open_urls` | Open multiple URLs in new tabs | `urls: array, [delayMs: number]` |\n| `claw_go_back` | Go back in history | - |\n| `claw_go_forward` | Go forward in history | - |\n| `claw_reload_page` | Reload current page | `[hard: boolean]` |\n| `claw_get_current_url` | Get current URL and title | - |\n\n### 🖱️ Element Interaction\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_click_element` | Click element by CSS selector | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_fill_input` | Fill input field | `selector, text` |\n| `claw_clear_input` | Clear input field | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_hover_element` | Hover over element | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_check` | Check checkbox | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_uncheck` | Uncheck checkbox | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_select_option` | Select dropdown option | `selector, value` |\n\n### 🧠 Smart Interaction (New)\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_smart_click` | Smart click: CSS → text → coordinate fallback | `selector, text, x, y, timeout` |\n| `claw_find_elements` | Find all matching elements with details | `selector, limit` |\n| `claw_wait_and_click` | Wait for element then click | `selector, timeout, scrollIntoView` |\n| `claw_get_page_structure` | Get page structure summary | `includeLinks, includeButtons, includeInputs, maxItems` |\n| `claw_scroll_to_element` | Scroll to element and highlight | `selector: string` |\n\n> **推荐用法（抖音点赞场景）：**\n> 1. `claw_find_elements selector=\"[aria-label*=赞],[class*=like]\"` → 探索按钮位置\n> 2. `claw_smart_click text=\"点赞\"` 或 `claw_smart_click x=960 y=650` → 智能点击\n> 3. 截图失败时用 `claw_get_page_structure` 替代了解页面\n\n### 📚 Bookmark Enhancement\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_enrich_bookmarks` | Enrich bookmarks with meta info (title, description, keywords) | `ids, timeoutMs, maxCount` |\n\n### 🔐 Login Session Management\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_save_login_session` | Save current cookies/storage for auto-restore | `name, domain` |\n| `claw_restore_login_session` | Restore saved login session | `name: string` |\n| `claw_list_login_sessions` | List all saved sessions | - |\n\n### 📄 Content Extraction (New)\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_batch_extract` | Batch extract multiple selectors at once | `selectors, options` |\n| `claw_extract_table` | Extract HTML table to JSON | `selector, includeHeader` |\n| `claw_extract_list` | Extract list items with field mapping | `containerSelector, fields, limit` |\n| `claw_compare_content` | Compare content snapshots, detect changes | `selector, saveAs, compareWith, clear` |\n\n### 🗂️ Bookmark Classification (Cloud)\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_classify_url` | Smart URL classification with cloud DB fallback | `url, saveToDb, category, description` |\n\n> **Setup**: Enable in extension settings → Bookmark Classification → Cloud Database → Enter API URL and Key\n\n### ⌨️ Keyboard\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_press_key` | Press single key | `key: string` |\n| `claw_press_combo` | Press combo (e.g. Ctrl+C) | `keys: string` |\n| `claw_type_text` | Type text with delay | `text: string, [delay: number]` |\n\n### 📸 Screenshot & Content\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_take_screenshot` | Screenshot of current page | `[fullPage: boolean]` |\n| `claw_get_page_content` | Get page HTML or text | `[type: html\\|text]` |\n| `claw_get_text` | Get element text | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_get_html` | Get element HTML | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_get_attribute` | Get element attribute | `selector, attribute` |\n| `claw_get_count` | Count matching elements | `selector: string` |\n| `claw_is_visible` | Check if element visible | `selector: string` |\n\n### 🔄 Mouse & Scroll\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_mouse_move` | Move mouse to coordinates | `x, y` |\n| `claw_mouse_click` | Click at coordinates | `[x, y]` |\n| `claw_mouse_right_click` | Right-click | `[x, y]` |\n| `claw_mouse_double_click` | Double-click | `[x, y]` |\n| `claw_mouse_wheel` | Scroll wheel | `[deltaX, deltaY]` |\n| `claw_scroll` | Scroll page | `[x, y]` |\n| `claw_fast_scroll_down` | Fast scroll down 1 screen | `[speed: number]` |\n| `claw_fast_scroll_up` | Fast scroll up 1 screen | `[speed: number]` |\n\n### 📱 Touch & Swipe (Mobile)\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_swipe_up` | Swipe up (Douyin/TikTok) | `[distance: number]` |\n| `claw_swipe_down` | Swipe down | `[distance: number]` |\n| `claw_swipe_left` | Swipe left | `[distance: number]` |\n| `claw_swipe_right` | Swipe right | `[distance: number]` |\n| `claw_tap` | Tap at position | `x, y` |\n\n### 📑 Tab Management\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_tab_create` | Create new tab | `[url, active]` |\n| `claw_tab_close` | Close tab | `[tabId]` |\n| `claw_tab_list` | List all tabs | - |\n| `claw_tab_switch` | Switch to tab | `tabId: number` |\n| `claw_tab_reload` | Reload tab | `[tabId]` |\n| `claw_get_active_tab` | Get active tab info | - |\n| `claw_attach_all_tabs` | Attach all tabs for control | - |\n\n### 🍪 Storage & Cookies\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_get_cookies` | Get cookies | `[domain: string]` |\n| `claw_set_cookies` | Set cookies | `cookies: array` |\n| `claw_get_storage` | Get localStorage/sessionStorage | `[type, origin]` |\n| `claw_set_storage` | Set storage value | `type, key, value` |\n\n### ⚙️ Configuration & Status\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_get_status` | Get current status | - |\n| `claw_get_config` | Get full configuration | - |\n| `claw_set_mode` | Set run mode | `mode: local\\|cloud\\|auto` |\n| `claw_health_check` | Health check | - |\n| `claw_diagnose` | System diagnostics | `[full: boolean]` |\n\n### 🧪 JavaScript\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_evaluate_js` | Execute JavaScript | `expression: string` |\n\n### ⏳ Wait Operations\n\n| Tool | Description | Parameters |\n|------|-------------|------------|\n| `claw_wait` | Wait milliseconds | `ms: number` |\n| `claw_wait_for_element` | Wait for element | `selector, [timeout]` |\n| `claw_wait_for_text` | Wait for text | `text, [timeout]` |\n| `claw_wait_for_url` | Wait for URL match | `urlPattern, [timeout]` |\n| `claw_wait_for_navigation` | Wait for navigation | `[timeout]` |\n\n## Configuration\n\n- **MCP Port**: 30000 (default)\n- **Extension WebSocket**: `ws://127.0.0.1:30000/extension`\n- **Built-in Token**: `autoclaw_builtin_Q0hpK2oV4F9tlwbYX3RELxiJNGDvayr8OPqZzkfs`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Extension not connected\n1. Check MCP server is running on port 30000\n2. Click extension icon → Settings → Test Connection\n3. Ensure authorization is not expired\n\n### Tools fail with \"No attached tab\"\n1. Click \"Attach All Tabs\" in extension popup\n2. Or manually click each tab to attach\n\n### Authorization expired\n1. Click extension icon → Settings\n2. Click \"Save Settings\" to re-authorize\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nautoclaw_wboke/\n├── SKILL.md                    # This file\n├── README.md                   # Documentation\n├── mcp/                       # MCP Server\n│   ├── package.json\n│   ├── dist/server.js         # Compiled server (v4.0.1)\n│   └── node_modules/\n├── autoclaw-plugin/           # Chrome Extension\n│   ├── manifest.json\n│   ├── background.js          # Service worker (v5.1.1)\n│   ├── popup.html/js         # Popup UI\n│   ├── options.html/js       # Settings UI\n│   └── icons/\n└── scripts/                  # Automation templates\n    ├── 抖音点赞.json\n    ├── 批量截图.json\n    └── 自动搜索.json\n```\n\n## Log Management\n\n- **Log Directory**: `~/.autoclaw/logs/`\n- **Retention**: 30 days (auto-cleanup on server start)\n- **Max Tasks**: 100\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772332035046}}
