{"type":"message","id":"25975353","parentId":"148ea3c8","timestamp":"2026-03-01T05:00:06.016Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王，✅ **任务完成！**\n\n## 📁 创建详情\n- **文件夹名称**: `今天`（ID: 64）\n- **书签名称**: `新华社`（ID: 65）\n- **网址**: https://www.xinhuanet.com/\n- **位置**: 其他书签目录下\n\n## 📋 收藏夹结构\n现在您的收藏夹中有：\n- **书签栏**: 2个测试文件夹\n- **其他书签**: \n  - `one`文件夹（2个）\n  - `今天`文件夹 ← **新建**\n    - `新华社`书签 ← **包含新华社网址**\n\n## 🔧 技术操作\n1. ✅ 使用`claw_create_folder`创建\"今天\"文件夹\n2. ✅ 使用`claw_create_bookmark`在新文件夹中添加新华社书签\n3. ✅ 使用`claw_get_bookmark_tree`验证创建结果\n\n**新华社网址已成功添加到\"今天\"文件夹中！** 🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":64589,"output":211,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64800,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772341185381}}
